WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.270
Wanna lose weight without drugs,
pills, or human rights?

00:00:03.314 --> 00:00:08.454
Then come to Venezuela, the most
effective weight loss solution in history!

00:00:08.574 --> 00:00:12.353
Other diets are unrealistic, regardless
of how hard you try, your country

00:00:12.387 --> 00:00:17.167
still has food. But thanks to ancient
Soviet secret, we've found a way!

00:00:17.252 --> 00:00:20.322
Here's how: our government price
controls lead, as they always do,

00:00:20.378 --> 00:00:25.308
to food shortages, leaving you unable 
to eat late at night, or most other times.

00:00:25.434 --> 00:00:28.794
Gee that sounds great, but won't
I miss America?

00:00:29.320 --> 00:00:32.290
Please, we have plenty in common!
You'll still find yourself standing

00:00:32.290 --> 00:00:36.430
in line for the latest release at the 
Apple store, like ESPN, we've gotten

00:00:36.490 --> 00:00:40.490
rid of some on-air talent, and we 
might be getting a cracker barrel.

00:00:40.564 --> 00:00:42.344
Look! There it is!

00:00:42.369 --> 00:00:45.079
I'm a journalist, is Venezuela
right for me?

00:00:45.160 --> 00:00:49.530
Of course! We've created designated
free speech zones just for you.

00:00:49.627 --> 00:00:54.207
You won't believe how many calories
you'll burn recycling, doing cross-fit,

00:00:54.287 --> 00:00:56.187
and taking community walks.

00:00:56.228 --> 00:00:58.068
Isn't that a violent protest?

00:00:58.105 --> 00:01:00.425
No, they're shooting a Pepsi commercial.

00:01:00.488 --> 00:01:02.018
Oh, that makes sense.

00:01:02.114 --> 00:01:05.464
But don't just take my word for it,
listen to one of our success stories.

00:01:05.546 --> 00:01:09.546
We have no toilet paper, but it's
okay because we have no food.

00:01:09.598 --> 00:01:13.078
Hahaha. When God closes a door,
he opens a window.

00:01:13.133 --> 00:01:14.813
There is pie on window?

00:01:14.889 --> 00:01:20.799
Learn how you can go from this,
to this. From this, to this. From this...

00:01:20.869 --> 00:01:24.349
Well what they have created in Venezuela
is a socialist paradise...

00:01:24.380 --> 00:01:25.090
To this...

00:01:25.203 --> 00:01:31.323
What you had in Venezuela wasn't
technically socialism, it was Chavezism.

00:01:31.422 --> 00:01:34.342
Venezuela: try it today!

00:01:35.044 --> 00:01:36.754
No.

